  {
    "ExternalId": {
      "Value": "hn:50406292"
    },
    "Type": 1,
    "Title": "Show HN: Coldframe, a honeypot that poses as a supermarket fridge controller",
    "Url": "https://github.com/hedgerow-dev/coldframe",
    "Description": "I built Coldframe, a honeypot that pretends to be a supermarket refrigeration controller. Inspired by the events on industrial fridge installations in the past weeks, I wanted to see what people would try against a convincing fake.\u003Cp\u003ETo learn more about this I built a honeypot that resembled perfectly the Danfoss AK-SM 800A and Dixell XWEB interfaces. Both of them are recognized on Shodan as real ones (an not as honeypots). It\u2019s one Python file using only the standard library, and it builds on e",
    "Metadata": {
      "score": "130",
      "author": "hedgerow-dev",
